   "subject": "Possible bug: layer_boxplots() and categorical data",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m not quite sure if layer_boxplots() is working correctly with categorical data. If you use the sample given in the help file, you may notice that the whiskers and points are offset a little, and if you change the width to something even smaller, it is quite noticeable. <div><br></div><div>Example:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mtcars </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">factor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cyl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mpg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layer_boxplots</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div>Produces this:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fqi7l4nugkM/VnHfPd9JinI/AAAAAAAATDE/HdR_LMrp9G4/s1600/bugPlot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fqi7l4nugkM/VnHfPd9JinI/AAAAAAAATDE/HdR_LMrp9G4/s1600/bugPlot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484591070000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3g4Ba4M2uScKYijWgyTodQ\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fqi7l4nugkM/VnHfPd9JinI/AAAAAAAATDE/HdR_LMrp9G4/s1600/bugPlot.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
